  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_hills_shutterstock636489641_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Aerial view of the mountains around Rio de Janeiro"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Perfect Day in Rio de Janeiro",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Ricardo Perna</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Flight attendant Ricardo Perna reveals his perfect day in Rio.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_cafe-nusa_breakfast_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Breakfast table with several dishes at Nusa Café"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Jogging Along Ipanema Beach</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I love starting my day with a run along the beach, with the sun on my face and the waves crashing next to me</li><li>Afterward I get a healthy breakfast at Nusa Café, where I especially love the dishes with avocado</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Nusa Café, R. Vinícius de Moraes 129, Ipanema",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Cycle to Sugarloaf Mountain</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_vermelha-beach_shutterstock437964253_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Vermelha beach in Rio"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Renting a bike in Ipanema is an easy and affordable way to explore the area</li><li>My tip: ride to Sugarloaf Mountain, take the cable car down, and cool off with a swim at Praia Vermelha</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Praia Vermelha, Praça General Tibúrcio, Urca",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_cristo-redentor_getty157185619_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Aerial view of the Cristo Redentor and the city of Rio"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Visit Christ the Redeemer</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>The panoramic view from Christ the Redeemer is simply breathtaking</li><li>I usually get around by taxi, which is the safest way to explore Rio</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Cristo Redentor, Parque Nacional da Tijuca",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
